          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 80 NW           ELLESBOROUGH            THE COOMBE                                            (MISSENDEN ROAD) 2/16                                       Coombe Hill Farm Cottage - GV                                         II House.  C17 bay to left, late C18-early C19 bay to centre, C19 extension of one bay to right.  Left bay is timber-framed with brick infill, part of the left gable rebuilt in flint and brick.  Centre bay flint with brick dressings, partly rebuilt in brick.  These bays have half-hipped thatch roof and brick chimney with rebuilt shaft to right of centre.  Brick bay with slate roof to left.  1½ storeys.  C20 2 and 3-light barred wooden casements, those to upper floor of left bays in thatch.  Small blocked C17 window to ground floor left.  C20 door with C20 gabled porch in right bay.  Outshot to rear.  Interior:  stop-chamfered spine beam and chamfered fireplace lintel in left bay; 2 staircases in outshot. Listing NGR: SP8446306159"
    }
  ],
